WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:18.143
The head priest called for two other priests, who quickly ran into the room.

2
00:00:18.163 --> 00:00:21.605
"Is everything okay, Master?"

3
00:00:22.065 --> 00:00:23.026
one priest asked.

4
00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:28.229
"I can't give this robe back to the Tang Monk," said the head priest.

5
00:00:28.249 --> 00:00:31.712
"But you must give it back," said the other priest.

6
00:00:35.212 --> 00:00:38.233
"This robe is a Buddhist treasure," said the head priest.

7
00:00:38.253 --> 00:00:41.314
"It comes from the Western Paradise.

8
00:00:42.474 --> 00:00:46.115
As Buddhists, we must do everything we can to keep it in our monastery."

9
00:00:46.135 --> 00:00:50.376
"The Tang Monk won't let you keep it," said the first priest.

10
00:00:51.656 --> 00:00:52.717
head priest smiled.

11
00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:56.278
There was an evil look in his eyes.

12
00:00:57.598 --> 00:00:59.619
"I have a plan," he said.

13
00:01:02.139 --> 00:01:06.365
Wukong was awake, meditating on a rooftop, when he heard footsteps.

14
00:01:07.446 --> 00:01:11.229
He looked down and saw two priests walking across the courtyard.

15
00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.492
They were carrying bundles of firewood.

16
00:01:14.512 --> 00:01:18.335
"It's the middle of the night," thought Wukong.

17
00:01:18.355 --> 00:01:20.677
"Why are they starting a fire?"

18
00:01:22.318 --> 00:01:26.401
The priests stacked the firewood next to the building the Tang Monk was sleeping in.

19
00:01:28.443 --> 00:01:29.223
thought Wukong.

20
00:01:29.243 --> 00:01:32.806
"I'll bet that head priest wants to keep our robe.

21
00:01:33.447 --> 00:01:34.548
He's planning to kill us."

22
00:01:35.924 --> 00:01:39.027
Wukong waited until the priests lit the wood on fire.

23
00:01:41.549 --> 00:01:43.570
Then he used his magic powers.

24
00:01:46.653 --> 00:01:50.956
The priests screamed and ran as the fire shot across the courtyard.

25
00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:55.040
One building went up in flames, and then another.

26
00:01:56.941 --> 00:01:59.844
Soon most of the monastery's buildings were on fire.

27
00:02:02.426 --> 00:02:04.788
Walls crumbled and roofs caved in.

28
00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:08.509
"Run for your life!"

29
00:02:08.769 --> 00:02:09.750
cried one priest.

30
00:02:10.911 --> 00:02:12.332
"Our monastery is ruined!"

31
00:02:12.753 --> 00:02:13.433
cried another.

32
00:02:14.354 --> 00:02:17.436
There was one building, however, that the fire didn't touch.

33
00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:23.041
The Tang Monk slept peacefully as the rest of the monastery burned down.

34
00:02:26.224 --> 00:02:29.206
next morning the Tang Monk woke up and opened the door.

35
00:02:32.369 --> 00:02:32.989
He gasped.

36
00:02:35.231 --> 00:02:36.332
drifted through the air.

37
00:02:37.676 --> 00:02:39.858
Burned pieces of wood lay in heaps.

38
00:02:41.178 --> 00:02:43.720
The buildings' walls were black and crumbled.

39
00:02:45.401 --> 00:02:47.022
no!" cried the Tang Monk.

40
00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:48.944
"What happened to the monastery?"

41
00:02:50.425 --> 00:02:51.285
He turned around.

42
00:02:52.486 --> 00:02:56.268
That's when he realized that the building he'd slept in was fine.

43
00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.551
Wukong walked over.

44
00:03:05.254 --> 00:03:05.935
cried the monk.

45
00:03:06.735 --> 00:03:07.536
"What happened here?"

46
00:03:08.744 --> 00:03:11.205
"The head priest tried to kill you," said Wukong.

47
00:03:11.225 --> 00:03:14.747
"He tried to set the building you were in on fire."

48
00:03:16.547 --> 00:03:18.308
The Tang Monk was confused.

49
00:03:19.829 --> 00:03:20.869
that building is fine.

50
00:03:21.209 --> 00:03:22.190
The fire didn't touch it."

51
00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:24.331
Wukong laughed.

52
00:03:24.351 --> 00:03:27.312
"I used my magic to stop the fire."

53
00:03:28.612 --> 00:03:30.193
Tang Monk scratched his head.

54
00:03:30.213 --> 00:03:32.514
"The rest of the buildings burned."

55
00:03:33.715 --> 00:03:36.776
"I used my magic for that too," said Wukong with a smile.

56
00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.882
"I used a spell that protected only your building and the robe.

57
00:03:42.224 --> 00:03:44.666
The spell made the fire spread everywhere else, though."

58
00:03:46.127 --> 00:03:48.469
Tang Monk's eyes filled with tears.

59
00:03:49.149 --> 00:03:49.990
He looked angry.

60
00:03:51.371 --> 00:03:52.772
"That's horrible, Wukong!"

61
00:03:52.972 --> 00:03:53.513
he cried.

62
00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:57.896
"If you had the power to stop the fire, you should have stopped all of it!"

63
00:03:59.417 --> 00:04:01.879
shrugged. "The priests here are evil.

64
00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:03.601
They deserved what they got."

65
00:04:06.463 --> 00:04:07.584
then they heard a shout.

66
00:04:08.628 --> 00:04:10.569
Two of the priests ran toward them.

67
00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.551
"Villains!" cried Wukong.

68
00:04:14.512 --> 00:04:16.193
dare you try to burn my master!

69
00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:19.255
I should club you with my iron bar!"

70
00:04:21.337 --> 00:04:23.678
The two priests fell to their knees and bowed.

71
00:04:23.698 --> 00:04:25.580
"Please forgive us!"

72
00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:26.500
one cried.

73
00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:30.163
"We didn't want to harm you or the Tang Monk.

74
00:04:31.184 --> 00:04:32.945
It was the head priest's idea!

75
00:04:32.965 --> 00:04:34.065
He's evil!"

76
00:04:35.426 --> 00:04:37.448
glared at the two priests for a moment.

77
00:04:38.828 --> 00:04:39.789
Then he relaxed.

78
00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:41.752
"Stand up," he said.

79
00:04:41.772 --> 00:04:43.334
"I believe you.

80
00:04:44.235 --> 00:04:47.359
Just bring us the robe so we can continue our journey to the West."

81
00:04:48.941 --> 00:04:50.643
we can't," said one priest.

82
00:04:51.584 --> 00:04:52.305
He was shaking.

83
00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:54.328
"The robe is gone!"
